      "id": 1,
      "text": "Stallings was incorporated in 1975, but its roots trace back to the early 1900s when Matthew Thomas Stallings bought 200 acres on the Mecklenburg‑County line.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
